  "description": "Actor Gyeong Wu-Hyeon is a devoted fan of painter Do Han-Ah. When a treasured piece of Han-ah’s artwork is stolen from him, Wu-Hyeon is devastated, but fate steps in when he unexpectedly runs into Han-ah again at a charity event. To his surprise, Han-ah doesn’t remember him at all, and a small misunderstanding quickly snowballs into the two of them falling into bed. Determined not to let the moment slip away, Wu-Hyeon sets out to show Han-ah just how much he truly values his work. As Han-Ah slowly begins to open up, he finds himself drawn to Wu-Hyeon… yet every now and then, he catches a cool, unreadable side to Wu-Hyeon that he just can’t figure out.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
